&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:37.5pt;min-height:37.5pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;前連結会計年度&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-right:4.6pt;"&gt;(自  &lt;span&gt;2022年４月１日&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:4.6pt;"&gt;至  &lt;span&gt;2023年３月31日&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;当連結会計年度&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-right:4.6pt;"&gt;(自  &lt;span&gt;2023年４月１日&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:4.6pt;"&gt;至  &lt;span&gt;2024年３月31日&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:22.5pt;min-height:22.5pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;　親会社株主に帰属する当期純利益又は&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　親会社株主に帰属する当期純損失（△）（千円）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;136,123&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;△74,247&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:22.5pt;min-height:22.5pt;"&gt;
